1. SCOPE

These terms cover the contents of this repository: the application's source
code, the term content, promotional text, images, icons, and brand elements.

The application itself is served at teknoterim.com.tr. Its source code lives
in this repository, where it can be read and contributed to.

2. USE OF THE APPLICATION

You may use Tekno Terim in your browser free of charge. No registration,
account, or licence is required. Your "learned" marks are stored only in
your own browser; nothing is kept server-side.

You may use the term explanations in your own learning, when training your
team, or in internal documentation with attribution. You do not need to
ask permission for this.

3. RESTRICTIONS

The following require prior written permission:

  - Copying the whole or a substantial part of the term content and
    republishing it elsewhere
  - Offering the content as part of your own product, glossary, or dataset
  - Bulk-scraping the content for the purpose of training an AI model
  - Using the "Tekno Terim" name, logo, or interface design in your own
    product
  - Using the images and icon set in this repository outside of it

4. THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

News summaries in Tekno Terim's "gündem" section are written originally; they
are not copied from the source, and every entry links to the original
article. Headlines and links belong to the respective publishers and fall
outside these terms.

Exchange rates are the indicative rates published by the Central Bank of the
Republic of Türkiye (TCMB), subject to their source's terms.

5. NO WARRANTY

THE CONTENT AND THE APPLICATION ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF
ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.

It is worth stating plainly what this means here: Tekno Terim is a learning
resource, not consultancy. Term explanations are for general use; they do
not constitute advice about what to do in a specific system, contract, or
incident. Exchange rates are informational and are not transaction rates.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the copyright holder
shall not be liable for any damages arising from use of the content or the
